      "id": "register-processor-data-provider",
      "name": "RegisterProcessorDataProvider",
      "category": "MassDebugger",
      "signature": "RegisterProcessorDataProvider(Provider Name, Entity Manager, Provider Function)",
      "params": [
        {
          "name": "Provider Name",
          "type": "Name"
        },
        {
          "name": "Entity Manager",
          "type": "TSharedRef<FMassEntityManager>&"
        },
        {
          "name": "Provider Function",
          "type": "UE::Mass::Debug::FProcessorProviderFunction&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "Void",
      "docs": "Registers the given ProviderFunction with the existing FEnvironment associated with the provided EntityManager.\nIf one doesn't exist yet, it will be created (i.e. will automatically call RegisterEntityManager() with the provided EntityManager).\nThe function will be called during data collection for the given FEnvironment.\nNOTE: there's no UnregisterProcessorDataProvider, the registered providers will automatically get removed along with\nthe rest of the data associated with the relevant EntityManager as part of UnregisterEntityManager call."
    },
